        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Mutation System:</strong> Stack blocks that dynamically evolve through shape shifting, color changing, size morphing, and piece splitting, creating unpredictable and strategic gameplay.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Blocks for Tactical Play: Use bomb blocks to trigger explosive clears, lightning blocks to zap rows or columns, and rainbow blocks to eliminate matching colors, enhancing chain reaction combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Dynamic Levels: Progress through 30 levels with color palettes that shift every five levels, offering a visually vibrant and ever changing puzzle experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable Visual Styles: Switch between cyber and terminal themes to personalize your gameplay, complemented by smooth animations and particle effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible Controls: Enjoy seamless gameplay with gamepad and keyboard support, including intuitive controls for movement, rotation, mutation triggers, and style switching.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive Difficulty and Scoring: Face increasing challenges with a progressive difficulty system and maximize scores through strategic chain reaction combos.<br><br><strong>Special Block Types:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Bomb Blocks: Create explosive chain reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Lightning Blocks: Zap entire rows and columns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Rainbow Blocks: Clear all blocks of the same color</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutation System: Trigger piece mutations for tactical advantages:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Shape Shifting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Color Changing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Size Morphing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Piece Splitting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move piece</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >↓: Fast drop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >↑/W: Rotate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SPACE: Trigger mutation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E: Activate special blocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F7: Switch visual style </p></li></ul></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Mutation System:</strong> Stack blocks that dynamically evolve through shape shifting, color changing, size morphing, and piece splitting, creating unpredictable and strategic gameplay.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Blocks for Tactical Play: Use bomb blocks to trigger explosive clears, lightning blocks to zap rows or columns, and rainbow blocks to eliminate matching colors, enhancing chain reaction combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Dynamic Levels: Progress through 30 levels with color palettes that shift every five levels, offering a visually vibrant and ever changing puzzle experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable Visual Styles: Switch between cyber and terminal themes to personalize your gameplay, complemented by smooth animations and particle effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible Controls: Enjoy seamless gameplay with gamepad and keyboard support, including intuitive controls for movement, rotation, mutation triggers, and style switching.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive Difficulty and Scoring: Face increasing challenges with a progressive difficulty system and maximize scores through strategic chain reaction combos.<br><br><strong>Special Block Types:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Bomb Blocks: Create explosive chain reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Lightning Blocks: Zap entire rows and columns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Rainbow Blocks: Clear all blocks of the same color</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutation System: Trigger piece mutations for tactical advantages:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Shape Shifting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Color Changing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Size Morphing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Piece Splitting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move piece</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >↓: Fast drop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >↑/W: Rotate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SPACE: Trigger mutation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E: Activate special blocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F7: Switch visual style </p></li></ul></li></ul>",
